# Wahid AI TPRM Scorer - Environment Variables

# =========================================================================
# BACKEND API KEYS (Add these to run the actual Real-World OSINT Engine)
# =========================================================================

# 1. News API (Free Tier available at https://newsapi.org)
# Used for Business Stability (Bankruptcy, Layoffs) and Reputation (Negative Media)
NEWS_API_KEY=""

# 2. Shodan (Free/Dev Tier available at https://account.shodan.io)
# Used for Cybersecurity (Exposed DBs, Open Ports, Vulnerabilities)
SHODAN_API_KEY=""

# 3. OpenSanctions (Free Tier / Bulk Data available at https://opensanctions.org)
# Used for Legal & Regulatory (Sanctions matches)
# If left blank, the system uses a fallback public watchlist check.
